WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.789
Access decisions and spending 3 Diary access and

00:00:04.842 --> 00:00:10.513
protected information Daniel receives approved delegated access sufficient

00:00:10.526 --> 00:00:15.645
to coordinate availability and business arrangements Private commitments

00:00:15.658 --> 00:00:18.750
may appear as unavailable periods without a personal

00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:23.355
explanation Where a private commitment affects agreed protective

00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:27.224
coverage the necessary operational information goes through the

00:00:27.303 --> 00:00:31.382
approved restricted route The existence of a protected

00:00:31.461 --> 00:00:34.158
block is not permission to investigate its purpose

00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:39.040
or disclose its detail 4 Routine decision authority

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.671
Daniel may arrange and move routine internal administrative

00:00:43.684 --> 00:00:47.000
meetings within agreed available periods when no protected

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:51.829
commitment external undertaking cost or specialist dependency is

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:57.145
affected Changes to executive decision meetings external visits

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:01.355
or protected periods require the identified decision-maker's approval

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.000
A request received directly by Lindiwe is entered

00:01:05.039 --> 00:01:07.658
into the controlled process before others are told

00:01:07.711 --> 00:01:12.474
that consequential arrangements are complete 5 Spending and

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:17.447
supplier authority In this fictional example only Daniel

00:01:17.461 --> 00:01:20.566
may place orders for pre-approved meeting consumables up

00:01:20.671 --> 00:01:24.342
to USD 2,000 per event within an already approved

00:01:24.447 --> 00:01:28.053
budget and supplier process He may not split

00:01:28.132 --> 00:01:31.592
purchases to avoid the limit He may prepare

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.697
a quotation comparison for larger expenditure but may

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:38.066
not approve it or release payment A change

00:01:38.132 --> 00:01:40.908
to supplier payment details goes to finance through

00:01:40.974 --> 00:01:45.987
the approved independent verification route The executive's preference

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.605
for a supplier does not remove these conditions
